# Rex keybinds

# Floats
Cmd-p              # new float
Cmd-Alt-n          # minimize float (toggle)

# Panes
Cmd-Shift-Return   # maximize pane

# Splits
Cmd-d              # new split right
Cmd-Shift-d        # new split bottom
Cmd-Return         # new split best fit


## Detecting actions

rex client ls                    # find the app's label
rex -C <label> actions           # client actions (client.*, pane.*,
session.*)
rex -C <label> actions --json    # includes argument schemas
rex actions                      # server actions: your init.lua ones like
session_last, jjtui

## Detecting keymaps

rex keymap
